### Banking API - sample requests (IntelliJ HTTP client / VS Code REST Client)
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Create a customer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "phone": "555-0101"
}

### List customers
GET {{host}}/api/v1/customers

### Open an account (use the customer id from the create response)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "type": "CHECKING",
  "openingBalance": 250.00
}

### Get an account
GET {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/ACCOUNT_NUMBER

### List a customer's accounts
GET {{host}}/api/v1/accounts?customerId=1

### Deposit
POST {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/ACCOUNT_NUMBER/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00, "description": "paycheck" }

### Withdraw
POST {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/ACCOUNT_NUMBER/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 40.00, "description": "atm" }

### Transfer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "FROM_ACCOUNT",
  "toAccountNumber": "TO_ACCOUNT",
  "amount": 25.00,
  "description": "rent split"
}

### Account statement (paged)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/ACCOUNT_NUMBER/transactions?page=0&size=20

### Freeze an account
POST {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/ACCOUNT_NUMBER/status?status=FROZEN
